cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  India Administrative Boundaries (ADM1 to ADM4):
  a GeoPackage compilation for GIS teaching
message: >-
  If you use this compilation, please cite both this repository
  and the underlying geoBoundaries database.
type: dataset
authors:
  - given-names: Ravi Kumar
    family-names: Pandey
    affiliation: >-
      Energy, Environment and Water Research Center,
      The Cyprus Institute, Nicosia, Cyprus
    orcid: 'https://orcid.org/YOUR-ORCID-HERE'
repository-code: >-
  https://github.com/cityaispace-ship-it/India_admin_boundaries
abstract: >-
  Administrative boundaries for India at levels ADM1 to ADM4,
  repackaged from the geoBoundaries gbOpen release into a single
  multi-layer GeoPackage for use in GIS training. This repository
  contains no new boundary data; the geometries are unmodified.
keywords:
  - India
  - administrative boundaries
  - GeoPackage
  - GIS education
  - geoBoundaries
version: 1.0.0
date-released: '2026-08-25'
references:
  - type: article
    title: >-
      geoBoundaries: A global database of political
      administrative boundaries
    authors:
      - given-names: Daniel
        family-names: Runfola
    journal: PLoS ONE
    volume: 15
    issue: '4'
    year: 2020
    doi: 10.1371/journal.pone.0231866
